---
import ThreeBackground from '../components/ThreeBackground';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Eric Cao — 在 AI 时代创造</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Python 开发者，开源贡献者，探索人与工具的边界">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    :root {
      --bg: #0a0a0f;
      --surface: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
      --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      --text-primary: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
      --text-secondary: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
      --text-muted: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
      --accent: #7c9cbf;
      --accent-bright: #a8c5e8;
      --accent-dim: rgba(124, 156, 191, 0.1);
    }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      line-height: 1.7;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .serif { font-family: 'Noto Serif SC', serif; }
    .page { position: relative; z-index: 1; min-height: 100vh; }
    .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
    
    /* Hero */
    .hero { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: 6rem 0 4rem; }
    .hero-name { font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 3.5rem); font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; opacity: 0; animation: fadeInUp 1s ease forwards; }
    .hero-tagline { font-size: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.25rem); color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.8; max-width: 600px; margin-bottom: 3rem; opacity: 0; animation: fadeInUp 1s ease 0.2s forwards; }
    .hero-quote { font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 2.5vw, 1.1rem); color: var(--text-muted); font-style: italic; border-left: 2px solid var(--border); padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; opacity: 0; animation: fadeInUp 1s ease 0.4s forwards; }
    .hero-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; opacity: 0; animation: fadeInUp 1s ease 0.6s forwards; }
    .hero-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; transition: color 0.3s ease; cursor: pointer; }
    .hero-link:hover { color: var(--accent-bright); }
    @keyframes fadeInUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
    
    /* Section */
    .section { padding: 6rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .section-title { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 3rem; }
    
    /* Projects */
    .projects-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4rem; }
    .project { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; padding: 2rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); transition: all 0.3s ease; }
    .project:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .project-header { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; }
    .project-name { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-primary); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.3s ease; cursor: pointer; }
    .project-name:hover { color: var(--accent-bright); }
    .project-stars { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); white-space: nowrap; }
    .project-desc { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; }
    .project-tags { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .tag { font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--accent-dim); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 400; }
    
    /* Thoughts */
    .thought { padding: 2rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .thought:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .thought-text { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.9; font-weight: 300; }
    .thought-meta { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 1rem; font-style: italic; }
    
    /* Footer */
    .footer { padding: 4rem 0 3rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin-top: 4rem; }
    .footer-content { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .footer-copy { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; }
    .footer-link { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.3s ease; }
    .footer-link:hover { color: var(--text-secondary); }
    
    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .container { padding: 0 1.25rem; }
      .hero { padding: 4rem 0 3rem; }
      .section { padding: 4rem 0; }
      .project-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
      .footer-content { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after { animation-duration: 0.01ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; transition-duration: 0.01ms !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <ThreeBackground client:load />
  <div class="page">
    <div class="container">
      <section class="hero">
        <h1 class="hero-name">Eric Cao</h1>
        <p class="hero-tagline">
          Python 开发者，开源贡献者。<br>
          在 AI 时代，探索人与工具的边界，思考创造的本质。
        </p>
        <blockquote class="hero-quote serif">
          "工具延伸了人的能力，但创造的意义始终在于人的选择与表达。"
        </blockquote>
        <div class="hero-links">
          <a href="https://github.com/caoergou" class="hero-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.032 1.531 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z"/></svg>
            GitHub
          </a>
          <a href="https://jike.city/ergou" class="hero-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
            即刻
          </a>
          <a href="mailto:itsericsmail@gmail.com" class="hero-link">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
            邮件
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2 class="section-title">作品</h2>
        <div class="projects-list">
          <article class="project">
            <div class="project-header">
              <a href="https://github.com/caoergou/airflow-extended-api-plugin" class="project-name" target="_blank" rel="noopener">airflow-extended-api-plugin</a>
              <span class="project-stars">★ 78</span>
            </div>
            <p class="project-desc">为 Apache Airflow 扩展 RESTful API。当官方 API 无法满足复杂工作流编排需求时，这个插件通过 CLI 命令提供了更灵活的集成方式。被多个生产环境采用。</p>
            <div class="project-tags"><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">Airflow</span><span class="tag">生产级</span></div>
          </article>

          <article class="project">
            <div class="project-header">
              <a href="https://github.com/caoergou/cnpip" class="project-name" target="_blank" rel="noopener">cnpip</a>
              <span class="project-stars">★ 43</span>
            </div>
            <p class="project-desc">解决中国开发者的实际痛点：pip 下载慢。自动测速选择最快镜像源，一条命令完成切换。简单的工具，解决真实的问题。</p>
            <div class="project-tags"><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">CLI</span><span class="tag">开发工具</span></div>
          </article>

          <article class="project">
            <div class="project-header">
              <a href="http://eric.run.place/mermaid-pic/" class="project-name" target="_blank" rel="noopener">mermaid-pic</a>
              <span class="project-stars">在线工具</span>
            </div>
            <p class="project-desc">在线 Mermaid 图表编辑器。零依赖、纯前端、无需构建工具——这是一种设计哲学的选择。当工具链变得复杂时，回归简单反而是一种创新。</p>
            <div class="project-tags"><span class="tag">JavaScript</span><span class="tag">零依赖</span><span class="tag">可视化</span></div>
          </article>

          <article class="project">
            <div class="project-header">
              <a href="https://github.com/caoergou/COVID-19Simulation" class="project-name" target="_blank" rel="noopener">COVID-19 Simulation</a>
              <span class="project-stars">★ 12</span>
            </div>
            <p class="project-desc">用 Python turtle 模拟疫情传播。代码简洁，逻辑清晰，适合编程入门。有时候，教育价值比技术复杂度更重要。</p>
            <div class="project-tags"><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">教育</span></div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2 class="section-title">思考</h2>
        <article class="thought">
          <p class="thought-text serif">AI 让编程变得更容易，但这不意味着创造变得廉价。工具的进步只是降低了表达的门槛，真正有价值的，始终是那些值得被表达的想法。当所有人都能写代码时，差异化不再来自技术本身，而是来自对问题的洞察和对用户的理解。</p>
          <p class="thought-meta">— 关于 AI 辅助编程</p>
        </article>
        <article class="thought">
          <p class="thought-text serif">开源的本质是分享，但分享的不仅是代码，更是解决问题的思路。一个 78 stars 的项目，意味着至少 78 个人遇到了同样的问题，并认为你的解决方案值得信任。这种信任，是开源最珍贵的回报。</p>
          <p class="thought-meta">— 关于开源的价值</p>
        </article>
        <article class="thought">
          <p class="thought-text serif">零依赖不是技术倒退，而是一种克制。当整个行业都在追求更多的抽象、更复杂的工具链时，选择简单反而需要勇气。mermaid-pic 没有构建步骤，打开 HTML 就能用——这是对用户时间的尊重。</p>
          <p class="thought-meta">— 关于工具设计哲学</p>
        </article>
      </section>

      <footer class="footer">
        <div class="footer-content">
          <span class="footer-copy">© 2026 Eric Cao</span>
          <div class="footer-links">
            <a href="https://github.com/caoergou" class="footer-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
            <a href="https://jike.city/ergou" class="footer-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">即刻</a>
            <a href="mailto:itsericsmail@gmail.com" class="footer-link">Email</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
